{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49427","headline":"临江仙 三 · 牛希济","name":"临江仙 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渭阙宫城秦树凋，玉楼独上无憀。\n含情不语自吹箫。\n调清和恨，天路逐风飘。\n何事乘龙人忽降，似知深意相招。\n三清携手路非遥。\n世间屏障，彩笔画娇饶。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"牛希济","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_49427.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_49427","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}